SUMMARY:Bearwallow to Wildcat Rock Overlook
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nBearwallow to Wildcat Rock\nLength
 : guestimate of 7-8 miles\nElevation: guestimate of max 2\,000'\nSpeed: 2.
 5mph average\nDifficulty: moderate\n\nThe hike will start at the Bearwallo
 w Trailhead up to Bearwallow Mountain where we'll connect to a new trail t
 hat connect to Wildcat Rock Trail. We'll follow Wildcat Rock trail to Wild
 cat Rock and then turn around and return the way we came.\n\nWhile I've do
 ne Bearwallow and Wildcat Rock trail\, I have not done this exact hike and
  since the connector from Bearwallow to Wildcat is somewhat new\, the tool
 s I use plan a hike do not show the connection\, so I'm guessing on the le
 ngth and elevation gain.\n\nDogs are welcome. I'll have my dog with me.\n\
 nFor those that want to carpool\, meet at the Ingles in Mills River betwee
 n the Ace hardware and the gas pumps. Meet at 8:45 for a 9:00 sharp depart
 ure. It's about a 40 minute drive from here. If meeting at the trailhead\,
  assume a 10:00 sharp start of the hike.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315562592
 /
